### 5. Test Enhanced Booking Management with Approval Workflow

#### 5.1 EV Owner Booking Flow
```bash
# Get booking summary (preview before confirmation)
POST /api/bookings/summary
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}
{
  "chargingStationId": "{station_id}",
  "reservationDateTime": "2024-12-15T10:00:00Z"
}

# Create booking (EV owner only) - Status will be "Pending"
POST /api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}
{
  "chargingStationId": "{station_id}",
  "reservationDateTime": "2024-12-15T10:00:00Z"
}

# Get own bookings (all)
GET /api/bookings/my-bookings
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}

# Get upcoming bookings only
GET /api/bookings/my-bookings/upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}

# Get booking history (past bookings)
GET /api/bookings/my-bookings/history
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}

# Update booking (EV owner, >12 hours before, only pending bookings)
PUT /api/bookings/{booking_id}
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}
{
  "reservationDateTime": "2024-12-15T14:00:00Z"
}

# Cancel booking (EV owner, >12 hours before)
DELETE /api/bookings/{booking_id}
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}
```

#### 5.2 Station Operator Approval Flow
```bash
# Get pending bookings (Station Operator or Backoffice)
GET /api/bookings/pending
Authorization: Bearer {operator_token}

# Approve booking (generates QR code automatically)
POST /api/bookings/{booking_id}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {operator_token}

# Reject booking with reason
POST /api/bookings/{booking_id}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {operator_token}
{
  "bookingId": "{booking_id}",
  "approve": false,
  "rejectionReason": "Station maintenance scheduled"
}

# Get specific booking details
GET /api/bookings/{booking_id}
Authorization: Bearer {operator_token}

# Get all bookings (Backoffice only)
GET /api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {backoffice_token}
```

