### 7. Test Business Rules & Validation

#### 7.1 Test 7-day Rule (Should Fail)
```bash
POST /api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}
{
  "chargingStationId": "{station_id}",
  "reservationDateTime": "2024-12-25T10:00:00Z"  // More than 7 days
}
# Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Reservation must be within 7 days from booking date"
```

#### 7.2 Test 12-hour Rule (Should Fail)
```bash
# Try to update/cancel booking with <12 hours remaining
PUT /api/bookings/{booking_id}
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}
{
  "reservationDateTime": "{time_within_12_hours}"
}
# Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Cannot update booking less than 12 hours before reservation"
```

#### 7.3 Test Station Deactivation with Active Bookings (Should Fail)
```bash
# Try to deactivate station with active bookings
DELETE /api/chargingstations/{station_id}
Authorization: Bearer {backoffice_token}
# Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Cannot deactivate charging station with active bookings"
```

#### 7.4 Test Booking Status Restrictions
```bash
# Try to update approved booking (Should Fail)
PUT /api/bookings/{approved_booking_id}
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}
{
  "reservationDateTime": "2024-12-16T10:00:00Z"
}
# Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Only pending bookings can be updated"

# Try to get QR code for pending booking (Should Fail)
GET /api/bookings/{pending_booking_id}/qrcode
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_token}
# Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Booking not found or not approved"
```

#### 7.5 Test Account Deactivation Rules
```bash
# Try to deactivate account with active bookings (Should Fail)
POST /api/evownerauth/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {evowner_with_active_bookings_token}
# Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Cannot deactivate account with active bookings"

# Try to login with deactivated account (Should Fail)
POST /api/evownerauth/login
{
  "nic": "deactivated_user_nic",
  "password": "password123"
}
# Expected: 401 Unauthorized - "Account is deactivated. Please contact support for reactivation."
```

